  Enter observable (or MULT), -Return for choices -> Choices are:
 1- VPI&SU helicity amplitudes (from Walker)           
 2- CGLN "F" amplitudes;  Chew, PR106, 1345(1957)      
 3- CGLN "A"s in 1/GeV**n units n=2,4,3,3 for A1,A2,.. 
 -1 or -2 will give amplitudes in 10**-3/mu units
